    "linkedin:92db413c0e7e4d5e63900ee8": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Full-Stack Engineer - AI First Development",
        "company": "Revision Dynamics GmbH",
        "location": "",
        "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4464026695",
        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "**Full\\-Stack Engineer — AI\\-First Development** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Company:** \n Revision Dynamics\n \n\n\n\n**Location:** \n Pakistan · Fully remote\n \n\n\n\n**Employment type:** \n Full\\-time contract\n \n\n\n\n**Compensation:** \n PKR 300,000–500,000 per month\n \n\n\n\n**Working hours:** \n Flexible, with regular overlap with German business hours (Europe/Berlin). Your schedule does not need to match German working hours exactly.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n About the role\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We’re looking for a full\\-stack engineer who enjoys building useful products, exploring unfamiliar technologies, and finding better ways to work.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You’ll join a team of four full\\-stack developers working on varied, technically challenging projects. We build and maintain production software while continually improving our tools, workflows, and engineering practices.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n AI is already part of how we build. We experiment with coding agents, custom tools, plugins, reusable skills, and automated workflows. We want someone who will actively contribute to that process and bring ideas of their own.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n What you’ll do\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* Build and maintain features across frontend, backend, APIs, and databases.\n* Take ownership of work from understanding the problem through implementation, testing, and delivery.\n* Learn unfamiliar technologies when a project calls for them.\n* Prototype ideas, evaluate the results, and help decide what deserves further investment.\n* Use AI tools throughout development while reviewing, testing, and understanding the output.\n* Create reusable tools, integrations, or workflows that improve how the team works.\n* Explain technical decisions, share discoveries, and collaborate openly with the team.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n What we’re looking for\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You have enough practical development experience to contribute independently. You’ve shipped real software and worked through the debugging, maintenance, and tradeoffs that follow.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You should bring:\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* Solid foundations in programming, web applications, APIs, databases, and Git.\n* Depth in at least one full\\-stack ecosystem, with a willingness to work beyond it.\n* Evidence of learning something unfamiliar and using it to solve a real problem.\n* Hands\\-on experience using AI tools for development, including an understanding of where they can go wrong.\n* The judgment to balance experimentation with simplicity, reliability, and delivery.\n* Clear communication: you ask useful questions, flag blockers early, and explain your thinking.\n* Openness to feedback and the confidence to offer a different view respectfully.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n*You don’t need to know every technology we use.* \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You’ll likely enjoy this role if\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* You build side projects, explore tools, or automate repetitive work because something catches your interest.\n* You can describe an experiment that failed and what you learned from it.\n* You’re willing to revisit a familiar approach when there’s a better option.\n* You care about understanding and verifying the code you deliver, including code generated by AI.\n* You enjoy a small team where your ideas can influence both the product and the development process.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n What the role offers\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* A fully remote position for someone based in Pakistan.\n* Close collaboration with experienced engineers.\n* Varied technical problems and ownership of meaningful work.\n* Space to propose experiments and help shape our engineering practices.\n* Practical experience building with AI and developing tools around it.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n How to apply\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Email careers@revisiondynamics.com with the subject Full\\-Stack Engineer — \\[Your Name]. Include your CV or LinkedIn profile, along with a brief example of something you built, learned, or improved recently.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Tell us what problem you were solving, what was unfamiliar, and what you learned. If AI was involved, explain how you used it and how you checked the result. Public code is welcome, but a clear description of private work is equally useful.",
